    "enUS": {
      "description": "The hierarchy of the Wild Gods is bent. Now, all is in motion, and the nature of the world is as malleable as clay!\r\n\r\nNo more will my kin suffer the fangs of predators, for now, we shall prey upon all who have devoured us!\r\n\r\nTremble, fragile creature, for you have neither the strength nor the speed to dissuade us!",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Predatory Hyjal Stag slain",
          "type": "monster"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Dissuade stags from acting as predators.",
